{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, נְבִיא","hw":"נְבִיא","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">נְבִיא</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m. prophet (</strong>Hebraism? also 𝔗 Syriac; v. BH<strong>)</strong>;—emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְבִיאָה</span> Kt, <span dir=\"rtl\">נְבִיָּא</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:1\" href=\"/Ezra.5.1\">Ezr 5:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:14\" href=\"/Ezra.6.14\">6:14</a>; pl. emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְבִיאַיָּא</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:1\" href=\"/Ezra.5.1\">5:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:2\" href=\"/Ezra.5.2\">2</a>.*","next":"BDB Aramaic, נָבָא","prev":"BDB Aramaic, נבא"}